    "pre_update_notes": "A minor release on top of 2.0.5: admin order creation with catalog parts, a much fuller invoicing module (quotations, proformas, credit notes, bank accounts, payments, reminders, five languages), a new invoice and email design, and bulk actions across the admin. It applies 8 small additive database migrations (new columns and tables only) \u2014 nothing in your products, orders or customers is changed or removed. Update from a single browser tab and leave the update page open until it finishes.",
    "post_update_notes": "After the update: fill in Settings \u2192 Company (address, VAT number, phone) so they print on invoices and emails. Under Invoices \u2192 Bank accounts add one account per currency. The non-English invoice wording is machine-translated: have it checked before use. Other admin roles keep using the existing custom-invoice permissions; no new permissions were added.",
